          "section": "3.1. Metallurgical Defects",
          "quote": "A widely adopted aspect causing the microcrack formation in the SLM-ed samples is the high thermal stress generated by the high temperature gradient during the SLM process. That high thermal stress could cause tearing along grain boundaries",
